<title>SINGAPORE: Bank Dharmala signs $20 mln loan facility.</title>
<headline>Bank Dharmala signs $20 mln loan facility.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it coordinated the signing on Thursday of a US$20 million term loan facility between Indonesia's Bank Dharmala and seven banks.</p>
<p>&quot;Bank Dharmala intends to use the proceeds from the term loan facility to finance working capital in anticipation of robust growth in lending activities as a result of the strong Indonesian economy,&quot; the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Bank Dharmala is 86.8 percent owned by P.T. Dharmala Sakti Sejahtera, it said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
